    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Hollowoak Guardian</h2><p>A tree corpse animated by Mother Sallow. It holds the front line, grapples exposed characters, and uses Root Heave when Armor Class makes ordinary attacks unreliable.</p><p>It is intentionally <strong>not resistant to Fire</strong>; area fire remains useful without removing the guardian in a single spell.</p>",
